@@ -1,3 +1,22 @@
 # Tidy
 
 A to-do list app built with Expo Router. Tasks sync with the Tidy API over HTTPS.
+
+## Releasing
+
+Store builds use EAS: `eas build --profile production --auto-submit`.
+
+Build numbers (iOS `buildNumber`, Android `versionCode`) are managed remotely by EAS and
+auto-incremented on every production build; don't add them to `app.json`. Bump the
+user-facing `version` in `app.json` for each new release.
+
+Before the first release, fill in:
+
+- `submit.production.ios.ascAppId` in `eas.json`: the numeric Apple ID of the app in
+  App Store Connect (App Information → Apple ID).
+- `secrets/google-play-service-account.json`: the Google Play service account key. It is
+  gitignored; never commit it.
+
+Google Play only accepts API uploads once the app exists in Play Console and a first build
+has been uploaded manually. Android submissions go to the production track as a draft;
+roll them out from Play Console.
